alculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the Roberts County record runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 9 grids, November to December came in under 90% of normal in 45 of those years. In 2026 so far, the middle of the grids got 14% of normal in February to March and 16% of normal in March to April. Grids 19316 and 19317 both had their driest year in 2011, at 43% of normal.</p>"}
